#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2256 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "The COMPTRT record carries TSVCDREF='UNII' exactly as required, so nothing is flagged. The second record is a different TSPARMCD and is outside this rule's condition. Adapted verbatim from FDA-SD2256."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset TS label="Trial Summary"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col TSSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col TSPARMCD type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter Short Name"
col TSPARM   type=Char label="Trial Summary Parameter"
col TSVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
col TSVALCD  type=Char label="Parameter Value Code"
col TSVCDREF type=Char label="Parameter Value Code Reference"
---
S1 | TS | 1 | COMPTRT | Comparative Treatment | IBUPROFEN | WK2XYI10QM | UNII
S1 | TS | 2 | CURTRT | Current Treatment | IBUPROFEN | WK2XYI10QM | UNII
